### Test Update Pharmacy Order Status
### Updated with only: pending, completed, cancelled
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

### Update order status to "pending"
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/68cfcb8e5ffb0bf425a65cbc/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "pending",
  "reason": "Order set to pending status"
}

### Update order status to "completed"
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/68cfcb8e5ffb0bf425a65cbc/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "completed",
  "reason": "Order completed successfully"
}

### Update order status to "cancelled"
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/68cfcb8e5ffb0bf425a65cbc/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "cancelled",
  "reason": "Order cancelled by pharmacy"
}

### Update order status without reason
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/68cfcb8e5ffb0bf425a65cbc/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### Test error cases

### Missing status field (should return 400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/68cfcb8e5ffb0bf425a65cbc/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "reason": "Missing status field test"
}

### Invalid status value (should return 400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/68cfcb8e5ffb0bf425a65cbc/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "confirmed",
  "reason": "Invalid status test - confirmed is no longer valid"
}

### Non-existent order ID (should return 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "completed",
  "reason": "Non-existent order test"
}

### Missing authorization (should return 401)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/68cfcb8e5ffb0bf425a65cbc/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed",
  "reason": "Missing auth test"
}